{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2016-07", "window": 1, "start_date": 1467331200, "end_date": 1467935999, "month_true_total": 189, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:11:46 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "24169540", "author": {"steamid": "76561198079525409", "personaname": "BANISHED", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198079525409/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 2048, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 999, "last_played": 1468539176, "avatar": "efd31740ca19bb103ff354ba51e708458963a54c"}, "language": "english", "review": "I am writing this as a warning for anyone who is thinking about buying this for online multiplayer. You can't simply join a game or be invited. You need to do port forwarding and all that junk, hamachi, or something.\n\nReally annoying and stupid because I bought a copy for my friend and we have to jump hoops to play with one another (which we haven't yet). I can't speak for others, this was my own personal experience.\n\nBesides that, I played the game on my own and found it to be fun for a while.\n\nI'd recommend this for local/solo play unless you're up for some how getting it to work online.", "timestamp_created": 1467934382, "timestamp_updated": 1467937206, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "24166339", "author": {"steamid": "76561198030157490", "personaname": "NixRagnos", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/NixRagnos/", "num_games_owned": 3104, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 592, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 571, "last_played": 1455506581, "avatar": "a8091fa7e1c73cf1289ef49f74e105e0c0f5562f"}, "language": "english", "review": "A fun, but very challenging 2D shooter where you try to survive and make it across a detailed handful of worlds. Includes an unlock system, bestiary and item glossary.", "timestamp_created": 1467924191, "timestamp_updated": 1467924191, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.472440958023071289", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "24162601", "author": {"steamid": "76561198001263796", "personaname": "Beardedpansy", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198001263796/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 65, "playtime_forever": 9246, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3308, "last_played": 1698971694, "avatar": "e377e16a125374bfdb05d9b8603ac3b103bf2c04"}, "language": "english", "review": "Okay, so I've sunk some time into this game... I think I can write an honest review. I really, really, really like Risk of Rain. I however have a bit of a problem with this company however, I always feel like they make a game (Starbound), get everyone all excited for it, and then it's has a super buggy launch, and they stop making content for there games. I have sunk 55 hours into this game, and trust me that is a lot of time for a game that get's boring pretty easily... I just want more content, more levels, items, enemies. SOMETHING... It's a great game, but it's losing it's appeal. If you got a group of friends, and you all want something to do, pick this game up. But you may have some problems connecting to one another.", "timestamp_created": 1467914314, "timestamp_updated": 1467914314, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "24160316", "author": {"steamid": "76561198069106561", "personaname": "KumaClaw", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198069106561/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 16562, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 14217, "last_played": 1724345074, "avatar": "2620c9c9687aeeb8ee4887b278eadc3842984d53"}, "language": "english", "review": "dis game guud. It got lot of fun. guud time. play with frans. play with self. hours and hours of fun.", "timestamp_created": 1467908225, "timestamp_updated": 1467908225, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.540527820587158203", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "24160006", "author": {"steamid": "76561198100944612", "personaname": "Play Warframe", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ahighlywantedbird/", "num_games_owned": 555, "num_reviews": 39, "playtime_forever": 15531, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 13634, "last_played": 1640632472, "avatar": "c56a21df381bffece577eb09bbb681fb71799be8"}, "language": "english", "review": "A very small and solid game. I wasted lots of time on it when my internet was down.", "timestamp_created": 1467907295, "timestamp_updated": 1657016867, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions"